  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Mar'li Evolves an egg on Mythic, never herself (#8075), and not on Normal",
  "contract": [
    "Evolve (2118116) evolves a target spider egg: it heals its target to full health (effect 67) and applies a",
    "+200% scale aura (effect 1). The eggs are Spider Egg creatures (14915) that cast Hatching (2118119, 10 s), so",
    "22 s into the troll phase Mar'li (14510) casts Evolve on the nearest free egg; that egg carries Evolve, starts",
    "Hatching, and 10 s later (live Mythic 2026-08-04: 10.2 s) hatches a Spawn of Mar'li (15041) she Evolves,",
    "never herself, so she neither carries the Evolve aura nor heals to full health. The evolved spawn never takes",
    "Growth (2118117; live: no Growth on it), while the Hatch Eggs spawns still do. Evolve belongs to Mythic and",
    "Ascended only, so a Normal Mar'li never casts it. A Normal and a Mythic hero each fight one Mar'li alone. The",
    "world's eggs share phase 1 and the fixture lives in the lane's own phase, so each hero places eleven eggs",
    "right after the pull. The Normal hero places all eleven within 2 yards: Hatch Eggs at 17 s claims the ten",
    "nearest and hatches them 10 s later, so it sees ten spawns and the eleventh egg unclaimed. The Mythic hero",
    "places ten within 2 yards and the eleventh 10 yd north; Hatch Eggs claims the ten, then the hero steps onto",
    "the eleventh, the only free egg left for Evolve. On the old behaviour a spawn carrying Evolve appears at once",
    "and no egg carries Evolve; with Growth it would make eleven Growth carriers."
  ],
